                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.8227/7: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Walton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-06-14T15:00:00-00:44">June 14, 1939—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 14—12:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>45. Aviation agreement signed today 11 a.m. Notes in identic terms relative to
                    article No. 3 exchanged in accordance with Department’s telegram No. 25, June
                    10, 1 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Walton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
